# CloneShield — Implementation Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete voice protection pipeline that adds imperceptible adversarial perturbations to audio to prevent XttsV2 from cloning the speaker's voice.

## Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Original Audio] --> B[U-Net PerturbationGenerator]
    B --> C["Perturbation δ ∈ [-ε, +ε]"]
    C --> D[Protected Audio = Original + δ]
    D --> E[XttsV2 Speaker Encoder - frozen]
    A --> F[XttsV2 Speaker Encoder - frozen]
    E --> G[Anti-Cloning Loss: -cos_sim]
    F --> G
    A --> H[Quality Loss: Mel + STFT + L1]
    D --> H
```

